        "content": "<p>The error is certainly clickable for me in VS Code:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-05-08 18-25-38.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"563x424\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/qjtGYijBETWe8I1mKw2rlCdK/Screenshot-from-2026-05-08-18-25-38.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/qjtGYijBETWe8I1mKw2rlCdK/Screenshot-from-2026-05-08-18-25-38.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-05-08 18-26-05.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"563x424\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/hhHfC2K9q8jQ_YpOm2XOsvhv/Screenshot-from-2026-05-08-18-26-05.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/hhHfC2K9q8jQ_YpOm2XOsvhv/Screenshot-from-2026-05-08-18-26-05.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>and this clearly shows why it doesn't match</p>",
